    "description": "<p><strong>Range:</strong> Self</p><p><strong>Area:</strong> 5-space-radius</p><p>You emit a burst of malefic lightning that tears into your foes and inspires them to fear.</p><p>Each enemy within a <strong>5-space-radius</strong> of you must make a <strong>Resilience</strong> check opposed by your <strong>Soul (Metaphysics)</strong> or take <strong>Damage</strong> equal to the difference in successes.</p><p>Additionally, you may choose to spend <strong>1 Resolve</strong> to inflict the <strong>Frightened</strong> condition on all enemies <strong>Damaged</strong> by this ability until the start of your next turn.</p>",
